<title>USA: Hawaiian Airlines Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Hawaiian Airlines Q3 net falls.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONOLULU, Nov 4 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  $0.05	  profit  $0.33</p>
<p> Net profit	1,369	  profit  3,363</p>
<p> Revs		101,213		  93,355</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted30,268		   10,068</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  $0.08	  loss    $0.57</p>
<p> Net profit	2,325	  loss    5,382</p>
<p> Revs		291,284		  254,327</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted27,400		   N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - 1996 nine months net includes a gain of $340,000 for reduction to reorganization  charges. Q3 1996 net includes a charge of $2.4 million for income taxes.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 load factor 72.8 percent vs 75.5 percent year ago.</p>
